package com.astrology.report;

public class SadeSatiPrediction {

    public static String getRisingPhaseText() {
        return "The Rising Phase marks the beginning of Saturn's seven-and-a-half-year journey across your natal Moon. During this period, Saturn transits the 12th house from your Moon sign. This phase is characterized by an increase in expenses, feelings of isolation, and a general sense of unease. You may find yourself questioning your current life path and experiencing a desire to withdraw from worldly affairs. Foreign travel or relocation is highly possible. It is a time for introspection and letting go of what no longer serves you. Financial discipline is critical during this phase.";
    }

    public static String getPeakPhaseText() {
        return "The Peak Phase is often the most intense period of Sade Sati. Saturn is now transiting directly over your natal Moon. The Moon represents your mind and emotions, and Saturn's heavy, cold energy can cause significant mental stress, anxiety, and depression. You may face obstacles in your career, strained relationships with family members (especially your mother), and a general feeling of being 'stuck' or burdened by heavy responsibilities. However, this is also a time of profound maturation. Saturn strips away illusions and forces you to face reality. Patience and hard work are your best allies.";
    }

    public static String getSettingPhaseText() {
        return "The Setting Phase is the final stretch of Sade Sati, where Saturn transits the 2nd house from your Moon sign. The intense emotional pressure of the Peak Phase begins to lift, but challenges may still remain regarding your finances, speech, and immediate family. You may need to restructure your wealth or deal with disputes over family assets. This phase is about consolidating the harsh lessons learned over the past five years and building a secure foundation for the future. As this phase concludes, you will emerge significantly wiser and more grounded.";
    }
}
